#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:5
#: 371500606fe443788cc978afbfda3f2b
msgid "Four Channel Planes"
msgstr "四通道飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:7
#: 12d95bd626fa430c8e7a3244544a453c
msgid ""
"The most common type of fixed wing plane is a 4 channel plane. As the name "
"implies, it has 4 output channels, and they control the roll, pitch, yaw, "
"and throttle independently."
msgstr "最常见的固定翼飞机是四通道飞机。顾名思义，它有 4 个输出通道，分别独立控制横滚、俯仰、偏航和油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:11
#: 0687e71f490a4f54bf877d1e5dc14222
msgid ""
"These are the default outputs for ArduPlane as it is such a common setup. It"
" is commonly referred to as an AETR setup."
msgstr "这是 ArduPlane 的默认输出配置，因为这种配置极为常见，通常称为 AETR 设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:14
#: deec4ae18a24456fa36f1caa8ab509b9
msgid "Remove the propeller from your aircraft before starting your setup."
msgstr "开始设置前，先从飞机上卸下螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:18
#: 6501db18166248399d8db08b04b526fd
msgid "Setting Up Your Plane"
msgstr "设置您的飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:20
#: ffaa574713314db3a774e7c3d600dfaf
msgid ""
"The most important step to setting up the plane is having the correct "
"inputs, outputs, and reversals. Inputs are covered on the :ref:`RC input "
"setup page <rc-throw-trim>`. After the RC inputs are configured, configure "
"the outputs."
msgstr ""
"飞机设置最重要的步骤是获得正确的输入、输出和反向设置。输入在 :ref:`RC 输入设置页面 <rc-throw-trim>` 中介绍。RC "
"输入配置完成后，配置输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:24
#: 04de7a3147a84058b14e714a466a5dfd
msgid ""
"Make sure the :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>` is set correctly for"
" the autopilot. If it is incorrect, this setup will fail, and the plane may "
"crash upon entry into any stabilize mode."
msgstr ""
"确保 :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>` "
"已为飞控正确设置。若设置不正确，此步骤将失败，且进入任何稳定模式时飞机可能坠机。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:27
#: ed774b92e15a414f8693089265bcd312
msgid ""
"Servo cables can be connected to any output of the autopilot, but using the "
"default channels 1-4 listed below is recommended. Set the SERVOn_FUNCTION to"
" the appropriate values."
msgstr "舵机线可连接到飞控的任意输出，但建议使用下面列出的默认通道 1–4。将 SERVOn_FUNCTION 设置为适当值。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:31
#: 391e987f4939471b96d14f9a8ad5fd70
msgid ""
"You can do this by setting the  parameter directly using Ground Station "
"software such as Mission Planner or QGroundControl using either the full "
"parameter lists or setup tab for outputs. In Mission Planner you can do this"
" on the SETUP -> Mandatory Hardware -> Servo Output page. Each channel has a"
" dropdown which can be used to select the function of the channel."
msgstr ""
"可通过 Mission Planner 或 QGroundControl 等地面站软件直接使用完整参数列表或输出设置选项卡来设置参数。在 Mission"
" Planner 中，可在 SETUP -> 强制硬件 -> 舵机输出 页面执行此操作。每个通道都有一个下拉菜单，可用于选择该通道的功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:43
#: 9921d3f529e1493dab2cf7eb1af1b5d1
msgid ""
"Most 4-channel aircraft utilize a Y-splitter for ailerons. It works well if "
"the servos have equal travel ranges and mirrored movement. If you wish to "
"set the trim, max, or min values for each aileron servo independently, then "
"use another output like channel 5 for the second aileron. Be sure to set "
"that channel's function correctly (4). This principle applies to any "
"additional servo or motor output."
msgstr ""
"大多数四通道飞机使用 Y "
"型分线器连接两个副翼舵机，若两个舵机行程相等且运动方向镜像，效果很好。若需要为每个副翼舵机单独设置配平、最大值或最小值，则使用另一个输出（如通道 "
"5）连接第二个副翼，并确保正确设置该通道的功能（4）。此原则适用于任何附加舵机或电机输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:51
#: c591fe137ac443538365be1057b9b002
msgid "Servo Function & Reversal"
msgstr "舵机功能与反向"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:53
#: 103e05cd1b8c4f9d9acdc62048a3f179
msgid ""
"The next step is to correct the servo reversals. Connect the battery (with "
"propeller removed) and turn on the RC transmitter. Switch to FBWA mode using"
" the function switch or a ground station command, and disable the safety "
"switch (if fitted). We use FBWA for setup because it prevents double-"
"reversing inputs and outputs. Double-reversing causes correct manual "
"behavior, but dangerous and destabilizing behavior in other flight modes."
msgstr ""
"下一步是修正舵机反向。接上电池（已卸下螺旋桨），打开遥控器，使用功能开关或地面站命令切换到 FBWA 模式，并禁用安全开关（如已安装）。使用 FBWA "
"进行设置可防止输入和输出双重反向。双重反向会导致手动模式行为正确，但在其他飞行模式中产生危险且不稳定的行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:60
#: eca6cac9d15846db9285569db59b861a
msgid ""
"When the plane is level, the servos should be near their trim (neutral) "
"values. Move the plane and leave the transmitter sticks centered while "
"monitoring the control surfaces to determine if the reversals are correct. "
"See the table for the correct control surface response to the movements. In "
"each instance, the plane should move its control surfaces to level itself "
"and coordinate its turns."
msgstr ""
"飞机水平时，舵机应接近配平（中立）值。移动飞机，保持遥控器摇杆居中，同时观察操纵面以确认反向设置是否正确。参见下表了解各运动对应的正确操纵面响应。每种情况下，飞机应调整操纵面使自身调平并协调转弯。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:79
#: c146b26d849648c78b995471855a92de
msgid ""
"If the any of the control surfaces do not respond correctly, reverse the "
"output by changing the corresponding SERVOn_REVERSED setting (from 0 to 1, "
"or from 1 to 0)."
msgstr "若任何操纵面响应不正确，通过更改对应的 SERVOn_REVERSED 设置（从 0 改为 1，或从 1 改为 0）反向该输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:83
#: 64cc3651db134065bc24e85c6072d19b
msgid ""
"The output can be reversed in Mission Planner on the SETUP/Mandatory "
"Hardware/Servo Output page, just check the box for the channel that needs to"
" be reversed. This will set the output's SERVOn_REVERSED parameter."
msgstr ""
"可在 Mission Planner 的 SETUP/强制硬件/舵机输出 页面反向输出，只需勾选需要反向通道的复选框，这将设置该输出的 "
"SERVOn_REVERSED 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:85
#: aef7fcd99de8418aafac57bc716592af
msgid ""
":ref:`KFF_RDDRMIX<KFF_RDDRMIX>` mut not be set to 0 (the default value is "
"0.5) for checking rudder movement in FBWA as the plane is rolled away from "
"level. If no automatic coupling of rudder to aileron for coordinated turns "
"by the autopilot is desired, then reset it to zero after this setup check."
msgstr ""
"检查 FBWA 模式下飞机横滚偏离水平时方向舵运动时，:ref:`KFF_RDDRMIX<KFF_RDDRMIX>` 不得设为 0（默认值为 "
"0.5）。若不希望飞控自动将方向舵与副翼耦合以协调转弯，可在此设置检查完成后将其重置为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:88
#: 107b52491c304e0da3b707d7ce4060eb
msgid "Confirm RC Transmitter Input"
msgstr "确认遥控器输入"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:90
#: 14ab92e6e00b43f2bf875f7c7e6f2d94
msgid ""
"Keep the plane level in FBWA mode and command the following inputs by moving"
" the sticks on your transmitter:"
msgstr "在 FBWA 模式下保持飞机水平，通过移动遥控器摇杆发出以下输入："

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:104
#: 0c10080ef76644688f72c7f3fbbe35c9
msgid ""
"If the control surfaces do not respond correctly, change the RCn_reversed "
"parameter (from 0 to 1, or from 1 to 0). Do NOT reverse the output on your "
"transmitter. It must be changed in the autopilot! Double check MANUAL mode "
"for the same inputs. If everything is setup correctly, the plane should be "
"almost ready to fly."
msgstr ""
"若操纵面响应不正确，更改 RCn_reversed 参数（从 0 改为 1，或从 1 改为 0）。请勿在遥控器上反向输出，必须在飞控中更改！再次检查 "
"MANUAL 模式下相同输入的响应。若一切设置正确，飞机应几乎准备好起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:110
#: 4b85ea22b1714453a00019f1c88befd2
msgid ""
"If in MANUAL mode the surfaces move backward with stick movements now, the "
"corresponding RC input should be reversed. To do this, in Mission Planner "
"RCn_REVERSED can be easily set on the SETUP/Mandatory Hardware/Radio "
"Calibration page. There is a check box \"Reverse\" next to each input bar. "
"You can reverse the correct parameter by checking the box. However, if "
":ref:`common-radio-control-calibration` was followed correctly, changing RC "
"input reversal will not be necessary."
msgstr ""
"若在 MANUAL 模式下操纵面对摇杆运动的响应方向错误，应反向对应的 RC 输入。在 Mission Planner 中，可在 "
"SETUP/强制硬件/遥控校准 页面轻松设置 RCn_REVERSED，每个输入条旁边都有「反向」复选框，勾选即可设置对应参数。但若正确遵循了 "
":ref:`common-radio-control-calibration`，通常无需更改 RC 输入反向。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:113
#: 6c2d8facbaa74c07a4c17525868a5a84
msgid "Servo Trim"
msgstr "舵机配平"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:115
#: b784436059d444588ed590727eb4820a
msgid ""
"Switch to MANUAL mode in order to adjust the servo trim values. The servo "
"trim is in the SERVOn_TRIM parameters."
msgstr "切换到 MANUAL 模式以调整舵机配平值，舵机配平位于 SERVOn_TRIM 参数中。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:118
#: af9b7d50b6494fa6aae5c3af7c773f4d
msgid ""
"Adjust the trim values so that the servo is centered when the transmitter "
"sticks are centered. If the trim value is not between 1450 and 1550 PWM, "
"mechanical trim adjustment is recommended."
msgstr "调整配平值，使遥控器摇杆居中时舵机也处于中立位置。若配平值不在 1450 至 1550 PWM 之间，建议进行机械调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:123
#: 84edf30e3c0b40928a5571b0dd125add
msgid "Servo Throw"
msgstr "舵机行程"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:125
#: 697e6e51a5ed4894b0583d5f05b1ea5f
msgid ""
"Finally adjust the servo throws (range of movement for each of the servos). "
"This should also be done in MANUAL mode."
msgstr "最后调整舵机行程（每个舵机的运动范围），同样应在 MANUAL 模式下完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:128
#: 2f981695f4df41e482f8ed9834c7dd4a
msgid ""
"Check any instructions that came with the plane for suggested throw values. "
"These are often specified in millimeters or inches of movement of the "
"trailing edge of the control surface close to the fuselage. If suggested "
"throw values are not found, then choose a throw that doesn't cause the "
"servos to \"bind\" (often indicated by a high pitched sound when servos "
"stall)."
msgstr ""
"查阅飞机附带的说明书获取建议行程值，通常以操纵面靠近机身处后缘的运动毫米数或英寸数表示。若没有建议行程值，则选择一个不会导致舵机「卡死」的行程（通常以舵机失速时发出高音蜂鸣声为提示）。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:135
#: 346f8c9abc2e4e5aae4a29ceebafaa86
msgid ""
"To adjust the throw, change the SERVOn_MIN and SERVOn_MAX values. The "
"defaults are 1100 to 1900. On many aircraft, more throw may be desired. "
"Changing throws to 1000 to 2000 or beyond is normal. Make sure that the "
"servos are still moving when nearing the extreme values."
msgstr ""
"调整行程时，更改 SERVOn_MIN 和 SERVOn_MAX 值。默认值为 1100 至 1900。许多飞机可能需要更大的行程，改为 1000 至 "
"2000 乃至更大是正常的。确保接近极限值时舵机仍在运动。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-four-channel-plane.rst:141
#: e2621f9d60274989be4c361f5588732e
